{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"## AC \"Per-pair node counts reconcile\" — evidence\n\nMeasured ahead of the close, because the sibling story `fb5f-54fd-96cc-4105`\nfailed its completion gate on this exact criterion with the work already\ncorrect and only the evidence missing.\n\nMethod — one collection pass per tree, counted per file, so the before and\nafter numbers cannot drift between separate pytest invocations:\n\n- **before** = parent commit `757ca4852d79357e0bc741e8424605ee3eecc98b`,\n  collecting both members of each pair\n- **after** = this story's commit `693030cb9ab`, collecting the surviving base\n  alone\n- both with `-m \"\"` so no marker deselection distorts the count, and\n  `-p no:randomly` for a stable order\n\n| base module | base | heldout | before | after | |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---|\n| tests/unit/metrics/test_bug_trends.py | 8 | 15 | 23 | 23 | OK |\n| tests/unit/metrics/test_code_health_composition.py | 1 | 2 | 3 | 3 | OK |\n| tests/unit/metrics/test_event_metrics.py | 8 | 5 | 13 | 13 | OK |\n| tests/unit/metrics/test_gha_adapter.py | 2 | 3 | 5 | 5 | OK |\n| tests/unit/metrics/test_git_metrics.py | 8 | 17 | 25 | 25 | OK |\n| tests/unit/metrics/test_jscpd_dup.py | 3 | 6 | 9 | 9 | OK |\n| tests/unit/metrics/test_lizard_complexity.py | 1 | 5 | 6 | 6 | OK |\n| tests/unit/metrics/test_metrics_extra_guard.py | 1 | 1 | 2 | 2 | OK |\n| tests/unit/metrics/test_registry.py | 4 | 13 | 17 | 17 | OK |\n| tests/unit/metrics/test_scc_loc.py | 1 | 15 | 16 | 16 | OK |\n| tests/unit/metrics/test_sidecar_metrics.py | 2 | 5 | 7 | 7 | OK |\n| tests/unit/metrics/test_snapshot.py | 2 | 3 | 5 | 5 | OK |\n| tests/unit/metrics/test_transcript_adapter.py | 2 | 4 | 6 | 6 | OK |\n| tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_canonical_link_diff.py | 5 | 5 | 10 | 10 | OK |\n| tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_canonical_outbound_equivalence.py | 7 | 4 | 11 | 11 | OK |\n| tests/unit/reconciler/state/test_backend_scalar_surface.py | 4 | 5 | 9 | 9 | OK |\n| tests/unit/reconciler/state/test_get_rotation.py | 1 | 8 | 9 | 9 | OK |\n| tests/unit/reconciler/state/test_richtext_port.py | 3 | 3 | 6 | 6 | OK |\n| tests/unit/reconciler/test_jira_dc_transport.py | 8 | 9 | 17 | 17 | OK |\n| tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_token_recovery.py | 21 | 3 | 24 | 24 | OK |\n| tests/unit/workflow/test_gate_coverage_input_rejected_5f96.py | 2 | 5 | 7 | 7 | OK |\n| tests/unit/workflow/test_gate_error_sidecar.py | 3 | 4 | 7 | 7 | OK |\n\n**22 pairs, 0 mismatches. Totals: 237 before, 237 after.**\n\nEvery merged base collects exactly the sum of its two predecessors, so the\nmerge neither dropped nor duplicated a test node across all 22 pairs.\n"},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1793510165346905124,"uuid":"4d02f9b9-a3dc-43da-a9da-5c9a422ec2f7"}